{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/628360/extras/108504843d7f9ef85088ca7a432c5936.avif?t=1762337628\" width=267 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/628360/extras/de322344daddb057f5b83523acc18707.webp?t=1762337628\" width=43 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Sir Noggin is a platformer inspired by the glorious 8-bit days and in the style of the Master System.\u00a0Relive the days where the controllers only had a couple of buttons and you'd have to re-tune in your television sets.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Join Sir Noggin on a quest to rid the world of the evil Wizard Derek and his minions. Use your gigantic sword to destroy critters while dodging the traps laid out across the land.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/628360/extras/ffab812b66abace2b24908265bbad72e.webp?t=1762337628\" width=99 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">20 Action Packed Stages spread across 7 unique Zones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Huge end level bosses to defeat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Five Different Power Ups to help you along your quest</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">An amazing retro 8-bit styled Soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Extras including Boss rush and Challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse